# Tooling lives in its own private repo, symlinked in at the root:
#   .claude    -> ~/Code/key-wam-claude      (jclarkfolklore/key-wam-claude)
#   conductor  -> ~/Code/key-wam-conductor   (jclarkfolklore/key-wam-conductor)
# This repo carries the talk, not the tooling. Same pattern as inspire-monorepo's
# .claude and .specify. Sync both with ~/.claude/scripts/sync-personal.sh, which
# discovers them through these symlinks.
#
# Extracted 2026-09-10 and removed from this repo's history in the same pass.
# Until then conductor/ and .claude/ were committed here deliberately; that
# reasoning now lives in each extracted repo's README.
.claude
conductor
